    "body": "## Motivation\n\nUnder `--skip-server-warmup` (and for elastic EP joiners), `_wait_and_warmup` posts `/freeze_gc` without first waiting for the listener. The POST lands before uvicorn accepts connections, fails once, and the GC freeze is silently lost:\n\n```\n06:12:13.0719  INFO:     Application startup complete.\n06:12:13.0734  post-warmup freeze_gc failed\n```\n\n## Modifications\n\nRetry the POST on `ConnectionError` for up to 10 s. Any other error still warns on the first attempt.\n\n## Tests\n\nThree CPU unit tests in `test_http_server_warmup.py`: retried until the listener accepts (fails on the pre-fix code), HTTP errors not retried, retry bounded.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\n- [x] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #37065475650](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37065475650)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #37065475211](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37065475211)<!-- s